WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.700
Your agent works for a week.

2
00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:05.270
Then it runs on the wrong account,

3
00:00:05.510 --> 00:00:07.410
forgets what it learned,

4
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:08.860
and nobody can say what it changed.

5
00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:12.370
It needs a home, its accounts, its memory
and a record of what it did.

6
00:00:13.130 --> 00:00:17.170
Fabric is the home for your projects
and their agents, in preview.

7
00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:21.570
It opens on four actions:
create or adapt an agent,

8
00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:23.640
open or create a project.

9
00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:27.980
Your coding agent asks its questions
and shows its plan first.

10
00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:30.690
Each agent runs on the account it should.

11
00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:33.760
Its dashboard and spend sit in one window,

12
00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:36.070
and Observatory shows what changed.

13
00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:38.290
The tools are available today.

14
00:00:38.840 --> 00:00:42.050
Coordination between agents
is the direction we are building.
